# UNDERDELVE: ladders are taken hold of from the ground only. A jump past a
# ladder with UP held stays a jump (every jump is committed); standing, UP
# takes the ladder, even one whose foot is just above Mo's head.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat pos 83 130
wait 10
expect grounded == 1
press A
hold UP 15
expect grounded == 0
expect climbing == 0
wait 40
expect grounded == 1
hold UP 5
expect climbing == 1
cheat room 4 4 243 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 20
expect climbing == 0
hold UP 20
expect climbing == 1
